    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wax Sii Sheegid Ku Saabsan Buurahii Israa'iil",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Wiilka Aadamow, buuraha reer binu Israa'iil wax u sii sheeg, oo waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Buuraha reer binu Israa'iilow, bal erayga Rabbiga maqla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Cadowgu wuxuu idinku yidhi, Ahaa, xataa meelihii sarsare oo hore annagaa hanti ahaan u leh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed wax sii sheeg, oo waxaad tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Iyagu cidla bay idinka dhigeen, oo dhinac kastaba way idinka liqeen, si aad quruumaha kale hanti ugu noqotaan, oo waxaa laydinku hadal hayaa bushimaha waranwarrowyada, oo dadyowgaad ceeb u tihiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed buuraha reer binu Israa'iilow, bal erayga Sayidka Rabbiga ah maqla. Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu ku leeyahay buuraha iyo kuraha, iyo webiyaasha, iyo dooxooyinka, iyo meelaha cidlada ah, iyo magaalooyinka laga tegey oo quruumaha kale ee ku wareegsan wax la dhaco oo la quudhsado u noqday, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Hubaal anigu waxaan dabkii masayrkayga kaga hadlay wax ka gees ah kuwa quruumaha kale iyo reer Edom oo dhan, kuwaasoo dalkaygii dhaxal ahaan isaga qaatay iyagoo aad u faraxsan oo dadkayga quudhsanaya si ay u dhacaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed dalka reer binu Israa'iil wax ka sii sheeg, oo waxaad buuraha iyo kuraha iyo webiyaasha iyo dooxooyinkaba ku tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal eega, masayrkaygii iyo cadhadaydii ayaan ku hadlay, maxaa yeelay, idinku waxaad sidateen ceebtii quruumaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Gacan taagan ayaan ku dhaartay oo idhi, Hubaal quruumaha idinku wareegsanu ceebtooday sidan doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse idinku buuraha reer binu Israa'iilow, waxaad soo bixin doontaan laamihiinna, oo waxaad midhihiinna u dhali doontaan dadkayga reer binu Israa'iil, waayo, iyagu dhaqsay u iman doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, bal eega, raalli baan idinka ahay, oo waan idiin soo noqon doonaa, oo idinkana waa laydin fali doonaa oo waa laydin beeri doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan idinku badin doonaa dad ah reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan, xataa kulligoodba, oo magaalooyinka waa la degi doonaa, meelaha burbursanna waa la wada dhisi doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan idinku badin doonaa dad iyo duunyo, oo iyana way sii kordhi doonaan oo wax bay dhali doonaan, oo dad baan idin dejin doonaa sidii markii hore, oo waxaan idiin samayn doonaa wax bilowgiinnii hore ka sii wanaagsan, oo waxaad ogaan doontaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hubaal waxaan ka dhigi doonaa in dad kugu dul socdo, waana dadkayga reer binu Israa'iil, oo way ku hantiyi doonaan, oo dhaxalkoodii baad ahaan doontaa, oo haatan ka dibna mar dambe ma aad gablamin doontid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Waxaa lagu yidhaahdaa, Dalyahow, dadka waad baabbi'isaa oo quruuntaadiina waad gablamisay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Mar dambe dad ma aad baabbi'in doontid, oo quruuntaadana mar dambe ma aad gablamin doontid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Waxaan ka dhigi doonaa inaan mar dambe ceebtii quruumaha dhexdaada laga maqal, oo mar dambena caydii dadyowga siima aad sidan doontid, oo quruuntaadana mar dambe ma aad turunturayn doontid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, markii reer binu Israa'iil ay dalkooda dhex degganaayeen waxay ku nijaaseeyeen socodkooda iyo falimahooda, oo jidkooduna wuxuu hortayda kula mid ahaa sidii naag caado qabta xaylkeed oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed cadhadaydii iyagaan ugu kor shubay dhiiggii ay dalka ku dhex daadiyeen aawadiis, iyo sanamyadoodii ay ku nijaaseeyeen aawadood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasaan iyagii quruumaha ku kala dhex firdhiyey, oo waddammaday ku kala firidhsanaayeen. Waxaan iyaga u xukumay siduu socodkoodu ahaa iyo siday falimahoodu ahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markay quruumihii ay tageenba dhex galeen, magacayga quduuska ah nijaas bay kaga dhigeen, waayo, waxaa laga yidhi, Kuwanu waa dadkii Rabbiga oo dalkiisii ka soo baxay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse anaa u naxay magacayga quduuska ah oo ay reer binu Israa'iil nijaas kaga dhex dhigeen quruumihii ay tageenba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed waxaad reer binu Israa'iil ku tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Reer binu Israa'iilow, anigu taas idinka aawadiin uma aanan samayn, laakiinse waxaan u sameeyey magacayga quduuska ah aawadiis, kaasoo aad nijaas kaga dhex dhigteen quruumihii aad tagteenba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo quduus baan ka dhigi doonaa magacayga weyn oo quruumaha nijaas laga dhex dhigay, oo aad idinku nijaas kaga dhigteen. Oo Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Quruumuhu waxay ogaan doonaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay markaan dhexdiinna quduus kaga noqdo iyagoo indhaha ku haya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, quruumahaan idinka soo dhex bixin doonaa, oo waddammadana waan idinka soo ururin doonaa, oo waxaan idin geeyn doonaa dalkiinnii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasaan biyo nadiif ah idinku kor rushayn doonaa, oo idinna nadiif baad ahaan doontaan, oo waxaan idinka nadiifin doonaa wasakhdiinnii oo dhan iyo sanamyadiinnii oo dhanba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba waxaan idin siin doonaa qalbi cusub, oo ruux cusubna waan idin gelin doonaa; jidhkiinnana qalbigii dhagaxa ahaa baan ka dhex bixin doonaa, oo waxaan idin siin doonaa qalbi jiidh ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Ruuxayga ayaan idin dhex gelin doonaa, oo waxaan ka dhigi doonaa inaad qaynuunnadayda ku socotaan, xukummadaydana waad xajin doontaan, waadna samayn doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad degganaan doontaan dalkii aan awowayaashiin siiyey, oo dadkaygii baad ahaan doontaan, aniguna Ilaahiinna baan ahaan doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba wasakhnimadiinna oo dhan waan idinka badbaadin doonaa, oo waxaan idiinku yeedhi doonaa hadhuudh, waanan badin doonaa, oo abaarna idinkuma soo dejin doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo midhaha dhirtana iyo waxa beeraha ka baxaba, waan badin doonaa, si aydaan mar dambe cay abaareed quruumaha uga dhex helin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasaad jidadkiinnii xunxumaa iyo falimihiinnii aan wanaagsanayn soo xusuusan doontaan, oo xumaatooyinkiinna iyo waxyaalihiinna karaahiyada ah aawadood ayaad iskaraahsan doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Taas idinka aawadiin uma aan sameeyo, bal idinku taas ogaada, reer binu Israa'iilow, jidadkiinna xunxun aawadood isu ceebsada oo facsharma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Maalinta aan idinka nadiifin doono xumaatooyinkiinna oo dhan waxaan ka dhigi doonaa in magaalooyinka la degganaado, oo meelihii burburayna waa la wada dhisi doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dhulkii cidlada ahaan jirayna waa la beeran doonaa, kaasoo cidlada ku ahaan jiray wax alla wixii soo dhex maraba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa la odhan doonaa, Dalkan cidlada ahaan jiray wuxuu noqday sidii beertii Ceeden oo kale, oo magaalooyinkii dumay oo burburay oo cidlada ahaa waa la deyray oo waa la dhex degay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasaa quruumaha hareerihiinna ku hadhay waxay ogaan doonaan in aniga Rabbiga ahu aan meelihii dumay dhisay, iyo inaan dhulkii cidlada ahaa beeray. Aniga Rabbiga ah ayaa saas ku hadlay oo waxaasna waan samayn doonaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
